# check_json_serdeable — the design: can this type round-trip through JSON?
#
# This is the declaration `viba.check_json_serdeable` is held to, given as
# a viba type so the judgment reads with the rest of the design-side signatures
# (viba-check-json-serdeable.md is the document; the Python layer is the
# one that takes the design apart).
#
# `ImportableTypeName` is a dotted name an import would find: the module of a
# `$module_name` entry, or a definition's full name in `$type_names`
# (`pkg.mod.Name`).
#
# Written out, every value has a JSON form; read back, that form has to land on
# one option. A value is read as null, a boolean, a number, a string, an array,
# an object — or by the tag an option carries, which is the key of its object. A
# sum whose options read as the same thing is a design JSON cannot round-trip,
# so it is refused. The product side (one tag per product, inline chains that
# end) is check_tag_and_inline's, run over the same design first.

CheckJsonSerdeable =
    Result[void]
  <- $viba_path list[str]
  <- $entry ($module_name ImportableTypeName | $type_names list[ImportableTypeName])
  <- $strict ((bool | nil) * { 默认为 False，表示允许给定 module_name 内部可以包含 <- 和 <<，函数内部会选择性忽略他们 })
  <- Hint[{
      $entry 给一个模块名：查这个模块里每个定义；给一组 type 名：查这几个定义。
      从定义出发把类型走一遍，每个和的选项要能和 JSON 互转：写出去有表示，读回来要么带不同的 tag，
      要么 JSON 凭种类分得开（null、布尔、数字、字符串、数组、对象）。数字不分 int 和 float；
      一个值和同一种类的类型也分不开（7 和 int）。产品那一侧用 check_tag_and_inline，先查。
      函数、Any、...、调用、裸代码块没有 JSON 表示；泛型参数没有实参就没有表示。
      $strict 给 True：函数（`<-`）和调用（`<<`）不跳过，按规则拒掉；
      给 nil 或 False（默认）：模块里的这两种定义跳过，剩下的照常判。
      答 Ok(nil)；不成立就答 $err，说的是第一处。
    }]

ImportableTypeName =
    str * Assert[{ 形如 xxx.yyy 等可被 import 的字符串 }]
